+The timing protocol needs a careful reading. Every lane uses the same finite fixture set and a result-dependent chain. A call produces a value that helps choose the next fixture and contributes to an observed checksum. That dependency keeps the arithmetic in the loop and stops the compiler from replacing repeated work with a constant.
 
